Attribution
-----------

This product includes software developed at puppyone (https://www.puppyone.ai/).

Parts of the app (the renderer under src/renderer, the design system package
packages/design-system, and the Electron main-process service under
electron/main/super-ontology) are adapted from the Super Drive of Puppyone
(https://github.com/puppyone-ai/puppyone), Copyright 2025 puppyone authors, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The adapted files were changed: product names,
identifiers, protocol names and application storage locations were renamed; the cloud,
account, agent, Git and update parts were removed; the engine start-up was rewritten to
locate and start `oo serve`. No logo, icon, font or other brand asset of that project is used.

Third-party software
--------------------

The package contains Electron (MIT) with Chromium and Node.js; their license texts are in the
application bundle (LICENSE and LICENSES.chromium.html next to the Electron Framework). The
other packages shipped inside the app are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which is generated
by `pnpm --filter @open-ontology/super-ontology-desktop gen:notice`. The `oo` binary shipped in
Resources/oo is built from this repository and carries the notices of the repository NOTICE.
